WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.305 --> 00:00:04.565
Once upon a time,

00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:08.195
Humans and the Winged people used to live side by side,

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.560
When the Naga Pearl gives off light,

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.200
The eyes of the sky can be opened

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.000
I have a plan

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.100
A perfect plan

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:31.760
What?

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.220
You have touched me

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:37.760
Cut it down

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.320
They have taken the Naga Pearl

00:00:46.085 --> 00:00:47.365
The Naga Pearl has to be destroyed

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.800
Everything has only just begun

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.380
Handsome or not?

